1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,236
Malaria is caused by Plasmodium, carried by the female Anopheles mosquito.

2
00:00:06,236 --> 00:00:10,611
In Nepal, Plasmodium vivax is by far the commonest.

3
00:00:10,611 --> 00:00:16,588
When an infected mosquito bites, thread like sporozoites enter the blood with its saliva.

